                    "_type": "Diesel Product Footer",
                    "copy": "Moving Out © 2020 SMG Studio & DEVM GAMES, published under licence by Team17 Digital Limited. Team17 is a registered trademark of Team17 Digital Limited. All other trademarks, copyrights and logos are property of their respective owners.",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
